<!--
Note: Use CTRL+H (If in notepad++) to replace instances of 
"Template Soundtrack" with whatever your mod is called

If you don't have any sound effects for your soundtrack
just delete this file and the sfx folder in resources

if you do have sound effects setting up the sounds.xml is
optional, but nice to do as it makes your soundtrack a bit
more compatible with MMC

to do this just make copies of your 'jingles', convert 
the copies to .wav format and put them in the sfx folder
then list them by filename here
-->

<sounds root="sfx/Template Soundtrack/">
